		{"id":"3b39197f96f2eb38","type":"text","text":"Food systems are points of high leverage because they connect earth & culture\n\nWho owns land? How is land owned? How do we make the transition from partitioned ownership to bioregional land stewardship?\n\nSame with modes of production and collaboration: production facilities, distribution facilities, digital spaces & collaboration tools/mechanisms\n\nWhat do local communities need to create internal value flows independent from/in parallel with the global monetary system?\n\nHow do you create and fund bio-regional-level production systems?\n\nHow do you incentivize maximizing utilization of resources to reduce consumption? Creating circular material flows?","x":4080,"y":-600,"width":430,"height":520},
